# Astro rules

## Doc map

- **Setup & commands** → [README.md](../../README.md)
- **System design & deployment** → [ARCHITECTURE.md](../../ARCHITECTURE.md)
- **Stack, paths & conventions** → [PROJECT.md](../../PROJECT.md)

## Pages & layouts

- Routes live in `src/pages/`; English is at the root and Dutch lives under `/nl/`.
- Shared page chrome belongs in `src/layouts/`; reusable UI belongs in `src/components/`.
- Use the `~/` import alias.

## Client scripts

- Keep interactive behavior in `src/scripts/*.ts`.
- The KNM UI is a vanilla TypeScript app in `src/scripts/knm/`; do not add React or Vue here unless the task explicitly changes the stack.

## i18n & styling

- Locale comes from the path via `src/lib/i18n.ts`.
- Tailwind v4 lives in `src/styles/global.css`; KNM-specific styling lives in `src/styles/knm/`.

## PWA & build

- Service worker behavior lives in `public/sw.js`; adjust cache versioning when caching changes.
- `SITE_URL` is required for production builds because it powers canonical URLs, Open Graph metadata, and the sitemap.
